# Intent: The unit's mute, vision off and full quiet, as three independent bits saved in a new NVS namespace (maipai_priv) and restored at boot: the codec is powered down in its constructor before anything can open it. Mute or quiet: the microphone cannot be opened (EnableInput returns at once, Read hands back paced silence), the ES7210 power registers are written by hand and read back (mic_off_verified, mic_regs). Quiet also drops all speaker output and freezes the servos. Vision off: StackChanCamera Capture and StreamCaptures return false and the avatar socket captures nothing. New MCP tools self.privacy.set (mute, vision_off, quiet: -1 leave, 0 off, 1 on; waits up to 1.5 s for the microphone read-back), self.privacy.get and self.privacy.set_policy (local_unmute). A privacy event is pushed on every change. The face drawing of the three states, the minute report fields and the stop word disarm are left out: this base has none of them yet.
