# Upstream: main/boards/m5stack/core-s3/cores3_audio_codec.{h,cc} of the xiaozhi-esp32 tree (MIT); firmware/main/hal/hal.cpp, hal_mcp.cpp, hal_ws_avatar.cpp, board/stackchan_camera.cc, stackchan/motion/servo.cpp; new hal/maipai_privacy.{h,cpp} (MIT)
